// Project Method: Fnd_Host_GetPictureFromLibrary ($pictureName_t; $image_ptr)

// Allows a component to get a picture from the host database's picture library.

// Access: Shared

// Parameters: 
//   $pictureName_t : Text : The picture name
//   $image_ptr : Pointer : Receives the image

// Returns: Nothing

// This method was automatically generated by Foundation on Oct 18, 2026.
